<p nodeId="f20e0d8f8dbd42439fd29bbfe0f72d87"><span color="rgb(152, 118, 170)"><em>SUCCESS</em></span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">(</span><span color="rgb(104, 151, 187)">0</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">, </span><span color="rgb(106, 135, 89)">"success"</span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">)</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">,</span><br /><span color="rgb(152, 118, 170)"><em>METHOD_NOT_EXIST</em></span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">(</span><span color="rgb(104, 151, 187)">1</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">, </span><span color="rgb(106, 135, 89)">"no such method"</span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">)</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">,</span><br /><span color="rgb(152, 118, 170)"><em>METHOD_NOT_ONLINE</em></span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">(</span><span color="rgb(104, 151, 187)">2</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">, </span><span color="rgb(106, 135, 89)">"method not online"</span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">)</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">,</span><br /><span color="rgb(152, 118, 170)"><em>DATA_ACTION_ERROR</em></span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">(</span><span color="rgb(104, 151, 187)">3</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">, </span><span color="rgb(106, 135, 89)">"fetch data error"</span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">)</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">,</span><br /><span color="rgb(152, 118, 170)"><em>DATA_EMPTY</em></span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">(</span><span color="rgb(104, 151, 187)">4</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">, </span><span color="rgb(106, 135, 89)">"data empty"</span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">)</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">,</span><br /><span color="rgb(152, 118, 170)"><em>METHOD_CONFIG_ERROR</em></span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">(</span><span color="rgb(104, 151, 187)">5</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">, </span><span color="rgb(106, 135, 89)">"method config error"</span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">)</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">,</span><br /><span color="rgb(152, 118, 170)"><em>DATA_ACTION_CONFIG_ERROR</em></span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">(</span><span color="rgb(104, 151, 187)">6</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">, </span><span color="rgb(106, 135, 89)">"data action config error"</span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">)</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">,</span><br /><span color="rgb(152, 118, 170)"><em>UNKNOWN_ERROR</em></span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">(-</span><span color="rgb(104, 151, 187)">1</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">, </span><span color="rgb(106, 135, 89)">"unknown error"</span><span color="rgb(169, 183, 198)">)</span><span color="rgb(204, 120, 50)">;</span><br /><span color="rgb(245, 34, 45)"><strong>Zeus测试返回“no such method”，尝试重新配置下MCC，稍等再重试</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="f439cf00f963428fb4c38a407cdfec4e"><span color="rgb(245, 34, 45)"><strong>其他错误一般为配置错误，检查配置即可</strong></span></p>
</km-content>
